  "prompt": "For each plan, what is the median number of payments of the subscriptions that started from 1 July to 31 August 2025, both days included? Count every payment of a subscription, refunded or not. The median is the middle count once the plan's subscriptions are sorted by it; with an even number of subscriptions, it is the average of the two middle counts. Return two columns, in this order: plan_name and median_payments. Return one row for each plan with such subscriptions. Any row order is fine.",
